appropriate and what is inappropriate behavior with respect to other
people, what to expect of others, how much to pry, and so on. These
folks are said to have "boundary problems."

Libertarian issues of agression aren't at issue here....this is stuff
all beyond the relatitively basic ideas of nonagression against
